rs.🎥 Video (optional, but recommended)A ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T21:18:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780808","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955600-1840310314350062","game_id":"steam-4955600","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Bob — the CapyTective 🔎","summary":"A detective by trade and by nature: sharp nose, sharper instincts. Nothing escapes the CapyTective — not clues, not loot, and definitely not the horde. His Detective's Nose only gets keener as he climbs: the higher the floor, the luckier the finds and the deadlier the hits. Take the CapyTective up the tower yourself — the free demo is out now! More capybara case files coming soon 🕵️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T23:23:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314350062","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955600-1840310314340714","game_id":"steam-4955600","kind":"announcement","title":"The Capy of Gods demo is OUT NOW — start climbing!","summary":"The tower is open! The Capy of Gods demo is now available. Download it for free and start climbing!🏯 What's in the DemoThe tower's first floor in an endless loop: climb, fight, fall, and come back stronger.4 playable capybaras, each with unique stats and a passive ability.6 auto-firing weapons, 8 animal instincts, and 20 items to build with.Full meta-progression: earn rubies to unlock permanent attributes, weapons, instincts, items, and characters.Procedural floors featuring secret rooms, missio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T03:15:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpos